 "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617762_1551403799568681_6587340234441348828_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mzbcH4TIRIIQ7kNvwHTyQiS&_nc_oc=AdqaPO4SiRDFVQWR03z1dATWLgp-MbEEUBVWmPSTXWRH9kqePmOOp7xvMvlk7Es_pCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAoAQ6FPZZF1784NvHBxMLK3VMfIYBzwnrWKDOe8Z8Upg&oe=6A5A3A0C"}, {"file_name": "Meta VR Screen4.png", "id": "23865475603127984", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_23865475619794649_4233579222625441540_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-U1PU3ncyUAQ7kNvwEYYYQJ&_nc_oc=AdoJrT1DXvmcJ9s4HiMRpLXOa2QURDCQX0wiZdAuwObE6oKl6chuF9aRgaNJOANnxIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCOImzxyB1Gkh_IZo8upCDdncDduXSiiDC5fqIL7jjH-w&oe=6A5A1E48"}, {"file_name": "Meta VR Screen6.png", "id": "821380286998535", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618938_821380290331868_6149583820790893256_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eWbjYHl2jagQ7kNvwE3E3UJ&_nc_oc=AdqIUSY10NCYkwxzDrLsGILdCpvQaJ3PsAmzaWb192Ae_0b0YYUW_YgLZXgG8MzYG1k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCTq1wiLVVGMPQqGY5sNfpmgpHNKrF7ydsMJmMK0vllIQ&oe=6A5A352C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "AnExplorer VR File Manager", "keywords": ["file", "manager", "transfer", "network", "cloud"], "long_description": "**AnExplorer VR File Manager** is a simple, fast, and powerful file manager for Quest and Android devices. It helps you organise, transfer, and access files across internal storage, SD cards, USB drives, network shares, and cloud storages. It works across all Android devices including **Meta Quest 2, Quest 3, Quest 3S, Quest Pro, and other VR headsets**, as well as phones, tablets, TVs, watches.\n{1329962442019615}\n**Storage Manager**  \nAccess files from SD cards, internal memory, USB OTG, flash drives, and external storage.\n\n**Network Manager**  \nConnect to SMB, WebDAV, FTP, SFTP servers. Stream or transfer files from NAS and shared folders.\n\n**Cloud Manager**  \nManage Google Drive, Dropbox, OneDrive, Box, Yandex Disk, pCloud and Mega storages. Upload, download, delete, or preview directly in the cloud.\n\n**Offline WiFi Share**  \nWirelessly transfer files between your phone and Quest on the same WiFi network. Send multiple files instantly without cables or hotspots.\n\n**Device Connect**  \nTurn your Quest into a mini server\u2014access files from your browser on phone or computer.\n\n**Image Viewer**  \nPreview images with zoom, swipe navigation, and slideshow support.\n\n**Music & Video Player**  \nPlay all types of audio like MP3, audiobooks and videos like movies.\n\n**Text Editor**  \nOpen and edit text files smoothly like TXT, HTML, XML, JSON, and more.\n\n**PDF Viewer**  \nRead PDF documents with fast rendering.\n\n**Archive Viewer**  \nView all types of archives lik ZIP, RAR, TAR, 7z, and more without extracting.", "short_description": "AnExplorer VR File Manager is a fast, powerful VR file manager for Meta Quest 2, Quest 3, Quest 3S, and Quest Pro. Wirelessly transfer files between your headset, phone, tablet, or Computer. Manage internal storage, SD cards, USB drives, cloud storage, and network storages. View images, play audio and video, extract ZIP, RAR, TAR, and 7z archives.  View PDF files and edit Text files easily. Enjoy complete VR file management, file organisation, and wireless media transfer without cables."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://anexplorer.io/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://anexplorer.io/terms", "publisher_name": "DWorkS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://anexplorer.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "39322